        "quote": "(a) Except as provided in subsection (b) of this section, a law enforcement officer may arrest a person under any of the following circumstances:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "ab767192-0384-5f54-aab3-b4b7c7333146",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 215,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:1",
          "start": 146
        },
        "quote": "(1) The officer has a warrant commanding that the person be arrested.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "cc5d3539-3b9a-522f-b62d-2033ad290e13",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 305,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:2",
          "start": 216
        },
        "quote": "(2) A warrant for the person’s arrest has been issued by a municipal court in this state.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "4593d9c8-41ac-5d94-917c-fdf642617962",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 505,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:3",
          "start": 306
        },
        "quote": "(3) The officer has probable cause to believe that the person is committing or has committed a violation of an ordinance and that the person has intentionally inflicted bodily harm to another person.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "664c467c-e6ab-5fa2-98ca-e24029919499",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 620,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:4",
          "start": 506
        },
        "quote": "(4) The law enforcement officer detained the person pursuant to TMC 2.40.250(c) or (d) and amendments thereto and:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "ce90159b-8ea9-5a4f-a9bb-ac08bdd8275b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 725,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:5",
          "start": 621
        },
        "quote": "(i) The person refuses to give a written promise to appear in court when served with a notice to appear;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "db2d0bf2-51f5-5c5c-871d-b7368636c637",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 910,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:6",
          "start": 726
        },
        "quote": "(ii) The person is unable to provide identification of self by presenting a valid driver’s license or other identification giving equivalent information to the law enforcement officer;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "01439536-8dde-5a9f-83f1-1899305a7113",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 972,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:7",
          "start": 911
        },
        "quote": "(iii) The person is not a resident of the State of Kansas; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "ae7d36f5-4466-5c76-ac75-3d6bf307ed40",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1138,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:8",
          "start": 973
        },
        "quote": "(iv) The law enforcement officer has probable cause to believe that the person may cause injury to self or others or may damage property unless immediately arrested.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.260 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "22dc8966-821f-54d7-b65e-2f217f42897c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
