          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:9",
          "start": 1139
        },
        "quote": "(b) A law enforcement officer may not arrest a person who is charged only with committing an ordinance traffic infraction or an ordinance cigarette or tobacco infraction unless the person charged has received service of a notice to appear and has failed to appear for the infraction. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 28, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-63. Formerly 2.110.260.)",
